{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48853","headline":"润州杨别驾宅送蒋侍御收兵归扬州 · 张祜","name":"润州杨别驾宅送蒋侍御收兵归扬州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冷气清金虎，兵威壮铁冠。\n扬旌川色暗，吹角水风寒。\n人对辎軿醉，花垂睥睨残。\n羡归丞相阁，空望旧门阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}